> myDMR2=eDMR(chr22.myDiff)
[1] "DMR analysis for all detected CpGs..."
number of iterations= 111
[1] 162.3308
[1] "raw myDiff:"
[1] 120192      7
[1] "max cpgs dist for region definition: 162"
[1] "auto correlation calculation. step: 100 dist: 1555"
> head(myDMR2)
GRanges with 6 ranges and 5 metadata columns:
